{"book":19,"chapter":20,"rubric":"STORAGE / CHAPTER 20","slides":[{"title":"What a backup is","sub":"Chapter 20 · Storage","short":"Backup","main":"A copy you restore from; the plan comes from RPO and RTO.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Not backups","RPO","RTO","Plan"],"captions":["RAID, a same-volume snapshot, and a replica are not backups","RPO: how much recent data we can afford to lose","RTO: how long the restore may take","Schedule, media, and retention follow from these two numbers"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"RAID, snapshot, replica ≠ backup","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"RAID, snapshot, replica ≠ backup","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"RPO: tolerable data loss","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"RAID, snapshot, replica ≠ backup","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"RPO: tolerable data loss","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"RTO: tolerable downtime","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"RAID, snapshot, replica ≠ backup","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"RPO: tolerable data loss","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"RTO: tolerable downtime","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n3","x":180.0,"y":122.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"the plan follows from RPO and RTO","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[10.3,18.6,24.6]}]},{"title":"3-2-1 and kinds of copies","sub":"Chapter 20 · Storage","short":"3-2-1","main":"Three copies, two media, one off site; full, incremental, differential.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["3-2-1","Full","Incr.","Differential"],"captions":["Three copies on two kinds of media, one off site","Full: a restore needs one set","Incremental: the last full and every increment after it","Differential: the last full and the latest differential"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"3-2-1:\n3 copies, 2 media","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"3-2-1:\n3 copies, 2 media","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":265.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"full:\none set","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"3-2-1:\n3 copies, 2 media","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":265.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"full:\none set","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":95.0,"y":110.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"incremental:\nfull + chain","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"3-2-1:\n3 copies, 2 media","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":265.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"full:\none set","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":95.0,"y":110.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"incremental:\nfull + chain","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n3","x":265.0,"y":110.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"differential:\nfull + the latest","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[9.6,15.4,26.4]}]},{"title":"rsync: slash and modes","sub":"Chapter 20 · Storage","short":"rsync","main":"A trailing slash changes the final path; first --dry-run -i.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["No slash","Slash","Attributes","Trial"],"captions":["